  "root_review": {
    "source": "Root read the complete 48039-byte preparer and exact emitted 52-path manifest. The proposal preserves every historical list prefix, appends the complete old checkpoint, preserves prior false qualification flags, and has a complete raw 294251-byte progress inverse. It records the actual 42-path fixture commit and both source-only corrections.",
    "archives": "Exactly 45 raw originals, one deterministic lossless gzip for both byte-identical historical seals, a seal map and the archive/history/fixture-chain reports. Original V35 failure, accepted independent closure and retained preflight negatives remain immutable. No caches or production/build files are proposed.",
    "executor": "Root read the complete accepted 9C fixture adapter and constructed/replayed exactly four substitutions: description, basis, single phase manifest/count/subject and exact predecessor phase. All 11 helpers and complete intake tail are byte-identical; full raw inverse succeeds. The separate Module peer verifies the emitted donors, Git preimages, history, lossless gzip, raw filters and exact path set.",
    "negative": "V35 remains a closed first-compile negative with 4 granted, 1 attempted and 3 unstarted groups; zero metadata and zero runtime. Historical closure rehashed 34068 distinct files and closed four original process instances. This release does not modify or reinterpret that certificate.",
    "ownership": "Root exclusively owns Main. This release grants only the exact 52-path progress/archive intake at clean 4ee30c526cd8909dfadfbbe187061fabcff9460b, with one existing progress replacement and 51 new archive paths including the manifest. No compiler, native runtime, source generator or new application qualification is authorized.",
    "successor": "After this exact intake, freeze the clean child for the reviewed V36 catalog and the complete same ordered 4+63 groups, 58+1249 declarations, fresh independent metadata/process closure and separate strict runtime authority."
  },
